# ripgrep config for coding-agent shells only (set RIPGREP_CONFIG_PATH in Claude Code's env, not in ~/.zshrc).
# Measured on M4 Pro / APFS, 65k-file tree: 14 threads = 1.75 s, 6 threads = 0.82 s (syscall contention).
--threads=6
# Minified/bundled lines spill 30-300 KB into context; cut them (preview keeps the match visible).
--max-columns=240
--max-columns-preview
# The umbrella dir is not a git repo, so node_modules is not ignored there (19k files).
--glob=!node_modules
--glob=!.tgrep
--glob=!*.snapshot
